pos": [2961.1826171875, 420.27081298828125], "widgets_values": ["fancyfeast/llama-joycaption-beta-one-hf-llava", "nf4", "cuda"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization_mode"}, "name": "quantization_mode", "label": "quantization_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}], "flags": {}, "id": 25, "type": "LayerUtility: LoadJoyCaptionBeta1Model", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: LoadJoyCaptionBeta1Model"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [7, 8], "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [374.90966796875, 443.62615966796875], "pos": [3968.631591796875, 410.58404541015625], "widgets_values": ["The photograph captures a minimalist, urban scene dominated by modern, glass-clad office buildings under a gray, overcast sky. Rain is visibly falling, creating a soft, diffused texture across the image. The buildings are characterized by their sleek, reflective glass facades, which mirror the gray sky and add a subtle sheen to the overall muted palette. The building on the right is the most prominent, with a distinctive, protruding, flat roof section that adds a dynamic element to the otherwise rectangular structure. This roof section appears to house a small green plant, adding a touch of natural color to the otherwise monochromatic scene. The building on the left is slightly smaller and less detailed, with a simpler, more uniform glass facade. Both buildings have visible, evenly spaced windows, some of which are illuminated by warm, yellow indoor lighting. The overall composition is balanced and geometric, with the rain adding a sense of movement and texture. The photograph emphasizes modern architecture and the interplay between natural and urban elements, creating a serene yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The image is crisp and well-composed, with a focus on the interplay between light, texture, and form.", "This photograph captures a modern urban skyline during a light rain shower. The image features three prominent glass-clad high-rise buildings, each with distinct architectural designs. The building on the left has a sleek, reflective glass facade with evenly spaced vertical lines, and its windows are illuminated with warm yellow lights. The building in the center, slightly taller, has a similar glass exterior but with a more angular, layered design, and its windows are also lit with yellow lights. The building on the right has a more complex design with a combination of glass and solid elements, and it features a small green rooftop garden at its peak. The rain is visible as thin, vertical streaks against the pale gray, overcast sky. The overall color palette of the image is muted, with shades of gray, blue, and yellow. The photograph has a minimalist and modern aesthetic, emphasizing the geometric lines and reflective surfaces of the buildings. The texture of the rain adds a dynamic element to the otherwise still scene. The image is sharply focused, with a slight depth of field that blurs the background slightly, drawing attention to the buildings in the foreground.", "The image is a photograph of a cityscape featuring three modern high-rise buildings with glass facades. The central building is the tallest, with a rectangular shape and a grid-like pattern of small, square windows. It has a slightly reflective surface, giving it a sleek, modern appearance. To the left, a shorter building with a similar glass facade but with larger windows is visible. The windows in this building are illuminated, suggesting that the building is occupied and possibly used for offices. On the right, another high-rise building with a vertical pattern of glass and metal is partially visible, showing a more textured, layered facade compared to the other two buildings. The sky in the background is overcast and light gray, with faint raindrops visible on the glass surfaces, adding a sense of depth and realism to the photograph. The overall color palette is muted, dominated by shades of gray and blue from the glass and sky. The photograph captures the essence of urban architecture, highlighting the modern design and the interplay of light and reflection on glass surfaces.", "This photograph captures a rainy urban scene featuring a busy roadway in the foreground, with three vehicles visible. The central focus is a white Jeep with large, rugged tires and distinct front headlights, driving on the wet road. The Jeep's headlights are on, reflecting off the glistening wet pavement. To the left, a white SUV is partially visible, and to the right, another vehicle, possibly a sedan, is seen further back.\n\nIn the background, a cluster of modern, glass-clad office buildings dominates the skyline, their windows illuminated, suggesting that the buildings are occupied and functioning despite the weather. The buildings are tall, with a mix of rectangular and slightly curved designs, creating a contemporary urban landscape. A wide pedestrian bridge spans horizontally across the middle of the image, with a few people walking on it, some carrying umbrellas.\n\nThe sky above is overcast, with a grayish-blue hue, indicating the ongoing rain. Green trees line the road on the right side, providing a touch of nature amidst the urban setting. The overall color palette is cool and muted, with shades of gray, white, and green, emphasizing the rainy, overcast atmosphere. The photograph captures the texture of the wet road and the reflective surfaces of the buildings and vehicles.", "This is a photograph of a modern urban scene featuring a large, multi-story commercial building with a prominent \"ARTN\" sign in bold white letters on the right side. The building's facade consists of a combination of glass and metal, with vertical lines creating a sleek, contemporary design. The glass windows reveal brightly lit interior spaces, indicating a retail or office environment. \n\nIn the foreground, there is a wide, wet road with a reflective surface, suggesting recent rain. A silver sedan is parked to the left, partially obscured by a small group of people walking along the sidewalk. The pedestrians, dressed in casual attire, include men and women of various ages and ethnicities, some carrying umbrellas or wearing raincoats. \n\nTo the left of the building, a series of small, neatly spaced trees with lush green foliage line the sidewalk, providing a touch of nature amidst the urban setting. The background is dominated by taller, similarly styled glass and steel buildings, creating a dense, metropolitan atmosphere. The overall color palette includes muted grays, blues, and greens, with the wet pavement adding a reflective sheen to the scene. The image captures a moment of everyday life in a bustling city.", "The image is a high-resolution photograph capturing a rainy urban scene in front of a modern commercial building. The building, occupying most of the background, has a sleek, glass facade with dark metal frames and large, illuminated windows revealing a brightly lit interior. The upper left corner features a large, white, uppercase \"T\" and \"N\" logo. \n\nIn the foreground, the wet pavement glistens with reflections from the overcast sky. Several people, dressed in various styles of casual and business attire, are walking along a wide, grey concrete sidewalk. Their reflections are visible on the wet ground. The people include a mix of genders and ethnicities, with some carrying umbrellas. A woman in a black dress and boots is walking towards the right, while a man in a grey suit and white shirt walks to the left. \n\nTwo neatly trimmed, green-leaved trees line the sidewalk, providing a touch of nature amidst the urban environment. A sleek, silver sedan is parked to the right, with its windshield wipers visibly in motion. The overall mood is a mix of modernity and daily life, enhanced by the rain's texture and the building's contemporary design."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 35, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 26, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [35], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [400, 272], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [3499.69091796875, 404.5009765625], "widgets_values": ["Descriptive", "very long", 1024, 0.9, 0, 0.6, ""], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 36, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "joycaption_beta1_model", "link": 37, "label": "joycaption_beta1_model", "type": "JOYCAPTIONBETA1_MODEL", "localized_name": "joycaption_beta1_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "extra_options", "label": "extra_options", "type": "JoyCaption2ExtraOption", "localized_name": "extra_options"}, {"widget": {"name": "caption_type"}, "name": "caption_type", "label": "caption_type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "caption_type"}, {"widget": {"name": "caption_length"}, "name": "caption_length", "label": "caption_length", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "caption_length"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name": "max_new_tokens", "label": "max_new_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_new_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_p"}, "name": "top_p", "label": "top_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "top_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "user_prompt"}, "name": "user_prompt", "label": "user_prompt", "type": "